[{"id":19490870,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDE5NDkwODcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/events/19490870","actor":{"login":"naude-r","id":1931708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzE3MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1931708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r","html_url":"https://github.com/naude-r","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naude-r/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2012-07-06T14:39:11Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/6809945","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/444#issuecomment-6809945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/444","id":6809945,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY4MDk5NDU=","user":{"login":"jpinner","id":850440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDQ0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/850440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner","html_url":"https://github.com/jpinner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-07-06T16:34:49Z","updated_at":"2012-07-06T16:34:49Z","body":"not necessary after calling 'deflater.finish()' on line 235\n\nOn Fri, Jul 6, 2012 at 8:00 AM, naude-r\nreply@reply.github.com\nwrote:\n\n> Hi,\n> \n> Using netty-3.5.0.Final http compression works just fine. After upgrading to netty-3.5.2.Final I found that some resources do not compress completely.\n> \n> This is evident in the actual sizes of the files as well:\n> \n> > -rw-rw-r--. 1 roelof roelof 192628 Jul  6 16:14 netty-3.5.0.js\n> > -rw-rw-r--. 1 roelof roelof 167636 Jul  6 16:14 netty-3.5.2.js\n> \n> Entries from my access log also confirm this.\n> \n> netty-3.5.0.Final\n> \n> > 127.0.0.1 30.507 - 06/07/2012:16:12:42 +0200 \"GET /mtnusa_web/style/jquery/jquery-ui-1.7.2.custom.min.js HTTP/1.1\" 200 <b>46315</b> \"-\" \"curl/7.21.3 (x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu) libcurl/7.21.3 NSS/3.13.1.0 zlib/1.2.5 libidn/1.19 libssh2/1.2.7\"\n> \n> netty-3.5.2.Final\n> \n> > 127.0.0.1 31.547 - 06/07/2012:16:13:47 +0200 \"GET /mtnusa_web/style/jquery/jquery-ui-1.7.2.custom.min.js HTTP/1.1\" 200 <b>40978</b> \"-\" \"curl/7.21.3 (x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu) libcurl/7.21.3 NSS/3.13.1.0 zlib/1.2.5 libidn/1.19 libssh2/1.2.7\"\n> \n> Notice the difference in not only file sizes but also final response sizes.\n> \n> The only related changes I could find are the following two issues:\n> [#404](https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/404)\n> [#406](https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/406)\n> \n> The http server is running with jdk 7 and thus the <i>JdkZlibEncoder</i> would be used.\n> \n> Are there any known issues with using JdkZlibEncoder?\n> \n> Took a quick look at the code for JdkZlipEncoder. Lines 236 - 238:\n> \n> ``` java\n>            if (!deflater.finished()) {\n>               numBytes = deflater.deflate(out, 0, out.length);\n>             }\n> ```\n> \n> Should the deflate not be called with <b>SYNC_FLUSH</b>?\n> \n> ---\n> \n> Reply to this email directly or view it on GitHub:\n> https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/444\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/6809945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jpinner","id":850440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDQ0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/850440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner","html_url":"https://github.com/jpinner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":19503724,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDE5NTAzNzI0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/events/19503724","actor":{"login":"jpinner","id":850440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDQ0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/850440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpinner","html_url":"https://github.com/jpinner","followers_url